  storyText: "Server Level\n\nFreezing air. Endless racks of Arasaka servers glowing red. Mirage: \"There's a gate here. I can feel the Wall.\"\n\nGuards are coming down the stairs.\n\n1. Jack in right now.\n2. Smash the servers to slow them down."
